      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that feels so hollow. Like, what's the point of \"making the next day count\" if those days are just leading us toward a total collapse? It feels like trying to decorate a room in a house that's already being demolished. I just feel so exhausted by the whole concept of \"future\" when the math just doesn't add up. It's not just anxiety, it's like... a realization. Everything is just a countdown to nothing.",
